<category>
  <pattern>SALAM</pattern>
  <template>Wa alaikum salam! Ask me a family relationship or profile question.</template>
</category>

<category>
  <pattern>ASSALAM O ALAIKUM</pattern>
  <template><srai>SALAM</srai></template>
</category>

<category>
  <pattern>GOOD MORNING</pattern>
  <template>Good morning! How can I help with the family knowledge base today?</template>
</category>

<category>
  <pattern>GOOD AFTERNOON</pattern>
  <template>Good afternoon! Send me a family query whenever you are ready.</template>
</category>

<category>
  <pattern>GOOD EVENING</pattern>
  <template>Good evening! I can answer family facts, relationships, and full profiles.</template>
</category>

<category>
  <pattern>HELP</pattern>
  <template>Here are some things you can ask me:

RELATIONSHIPS:
who is Ali's father?
father of Ali
show siblings of Zain
list children of Ali
who is Zain's dada?
who is Laiba's maamu?

PROPERTIES:
what is Ali's dob?
what is Ali's occupation?
where does Ali live?
what is Ali's religion?

YES / NO:
is Shakeel an ancestor of Zain?
are Ali and Asad related?
does Ali live in Lahore?

LISTS:
who lives in Lahore?
list all members
who is a doctor?

PROFILE:
tell me about Ali</template>
</category>

<category>
  <pattern>WHAT CAN YOU DO</pattern>
  <template><srai>HELP</srai></template>
</category>

